{
  "info": {
    "name": "DS Kaltim — 3 langkah TTE",
    "description": "Alur yang sama dengan ETAM:\n1. POST /ttdds — unggah PDF, dapat kode\n2. POST /sign — kode + passphrase\n3. POST /dokumen — ambil PDF sudah TTE\n\nCara pakai:\n- Import collection + environment `DS Kaltim — ETAM`\n- Isi environment: token, template, nik, passphrase\n- Di request 1, pilih file PDF di field `pdf`\n- Jalankan urut 1 → 2 → 3. Kode dari langkah 1 tersimpan otomatis ke `{{kode}}`.\n- Langkah 3: pakai **Send and Download** kalau responsnya file PDF.\n\nGanti `base_url` ke `https://ds.kaltimprov.go.id/api/v2` kalau Diskominfo minta v2.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "https://ds.kaltimprov.go.id/api" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "template", "value": "" },
    { "key": "nik", "value": "" },
    { "key": "passphrase", "value": "" },
    { "key": "keterangan", "value": "Uji DS ETAM" },
    { "key": "kode", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Kirim dokumen (ttdds)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "let json = null;",
              "try { json = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
              "if (json) {",
              "  console.log(json);",
              "  const kode = (json.data && json.data.kode) || json.kode;",
              "  if (kode) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('kode', kode);",
              "    pm.environment.set('kode', kode);",
              "    pm.test('Dapat kode dokumen', function () { pm.expect(kode).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty; });",
              "  }",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "pdf",
              "type": "file",
              "src": [],
              "description": "Pilih file PDF yang akan dikirim ke DS"
            },
            {
              "key": "nik",
              "value": "{{nik}}",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "template",
              "value": "{{template}}",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "keterangan",
              "value": "{{keterangan}}",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": "{{base_url}}/ttdds?token={{token}}",
        "description": "Multipart: nik, template, keterangan, pdf (file).\nAuth: query `token`.\nSukses biasanya JSON `{ success, data.kode, message }`."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Tanda tangan (sign)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "try { console.log(pm.response.json()); } catch (e) { console.log(pm.response.text()); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            { "key": "kode", "value": "{{kode}}", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "passphrase", "value": "{{passphrase}}", "type": "text" }
          ]
        },
        "url": "{{base_url}}/sign?token={{token}}",
        "description": "Form: kode (dari langkah 1) + passphrase pejabat.\nTidak mengembalikan PDF — hanya JSON status."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Ambil dokumen (dokumen)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const body = pm.response.text() || '';",
              "if (body.indexOf('%PDF') === 0) {",
              "  pm.test('Respons PDF', function () { pm.expect(body).to.include('%PDF'); });",
              "} else {",
              "  try { console.log(pm.response.json()); } catch (e) { console.log(body); }",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            { "key": "kode", "value": "{{kode}}", "type": "text" }
          ]
        },
        "url": "{{base_url}}/dokumen?token={{token}}",
        "description": "Form: kode saja. Kalau sukses, body-nya file PDF.\nDi Postman: Send and Download."
      }
    }
  ]
}
